enclave-recruit-contract-text =
    DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE FORM 104-E
    RESTRICTED / CLEARANCE REQUIRED
    SUBJECT: UNIFORM ENLISTMENT AND OATH OF IDEOLOGICAL PURITY

    SECTION I: DECLARATION OF PATRIOTIC INTENT

    I, [PRINT NAME], do hereby declare my absolute and unwavering loyalty to the United States of America. I acknowledge that the insidious threat of Communist subversion, Marxist ideology, and all forms of un-American sentiment pose an existential danger to the liberty, prosperity, and survival of the Republic.

    By initiating this contract, I swear to aggressively root out, report, and neutralize any socialist infiltration within my unit, my community, and my nation. I surrender all personal ties that may compromise the security of the American way of life and dedicate my physical and mental faculties entirely to the preservation of the United States.

    SECTION II: CONTINUITY OF SERVICE CLAUSE

    Subsection A: Chain of Command Redirection

    The signatory acknowledges that the standard chain of command is a peacetime construct. In the event of a national emergency, total strategic nuclear exchange, or catastrophic collapse of the public-facing federal government, the signatory agrees that their allegiance bypasses all surviving local, regional, or standard military leadership.

    Total operational control of the signatory is immediately and irrevocably transferred to the Executive Continuity Authority (ECA).

    Subsection B: Undisclosed Redeployment

    Upon activation of the ECA protocols, the signatory consents to immediate, blind extraction to secure, undisclosed installations (including but not limited to subterranean habitats, deep-sea platforms, or off-shore energy facilities). The signatory waives all rights to inform next-of-kin regarding their deployment status or location.

    Subsection C: The "Purification" Directive

    The signatory agrees that under catastrophic survival conditions, standard constitutional protections may be suspended by the ECA for the purpose of preserving the true American genetic and ideological baseline. The signatory swears to execute any orders directed toward the eradication of mutated, compromised, or ideologically contaminated populations without hesitation or moral objection.

    SECTION III: PERPETUAL BINDING AGREEMENT

    I understand that this contract supersedes all prior enlistment oaths, UCMJ guidelines, and civilian laws. I recognize that the true sovereign authority of the United States rests solely with the designated highest-echelon executive authorities, operating in the shadows to guarantee the nation's future.

    I understand that service to this Continuity Command is perpetual. It does not expire upon the end of a standard military contract, nor does it terminate upon the destruction of the United States landmass.

    Failure to comply with the directives of the Executive Continuity Authority, or any attempt to break this seal of secrecy, is classified as High Treason and will result in immediate termination.

    SIGNATURE OF ENLISTEE: _______________________________________ DATE: //2296

    THUMBPRINT / GENETIC SUBMISSION:

    AUTHORIZED CONTINUITY LIAISON:
    Daniel Kukowski

    By signing, the liaison confirms the candidate's genetic baseline and ideological purity meet the standards of the Executive Authority.

enclave-recruit-oath-text =
    "I, { $name }, do solemnly swear that I will support and defend the true and enduring spirit of the United States of America against all enemies, foreign, domestic, and ideological.

    I swear that I bear no allegiance to the fleeting constructs of peacetime governance, nor to any foreign powers, socialist doctrines, or communist subversions that threaten to rot the core of the American way of life.

    I pledge my absolute and unwavering obedience to the Executive Continuity Authority. I will follow all orders of the Commander-in-Chief and the designated officers appointed over me, in the shadows and in the light, through the ashes of the old world and the dawn of the new.

    I swear to maintain the absolute, impenetrable secrecy of my commission. I will carry the burden of the nation's survival in silence, forsaking all past attachments that might compromise the security of the ultimate American redoubt.

    I pledge my body, my mind, and my blood to the preservation and purification of the Republic. I will strike down the compromised, the contaminated, and the treasonous without hesitation, mercy, or remorse.

    May the eternal flame of liberty guide my hand, and may swift and total termination be my reward should I ever break this sacred trust.

    So help me God."
